# OintOS ISO catalog — pinned sha256 for the staging producer.
#
# The producer (New-OIntOSStaging.ps1) downloads the ISO from ISO_URL,
# verifies Get-FileHash against ISO_SHA256, and REFUSES on mismatch.
# Update both lines together when a new build is released; never bump
# the URL without the hash (fail-closed, same rule as plan.py).
#
# build27 (2026-09-11) — GitHub release, 2 parça (2GB limit):
# https://github.com/ervinnasiri-99/ointos/releases/tag/build27
# Birleştir: cat OintOS-1.0-amd64.iso.part-aa OintOS-1.0-amd64.iso.part-ab > OintOS-1.0-amd64.iso
ISO_URL=https://github.com/ervinnasiri-99/ointos/releases/download/build27/OintOS-1.0-amd64.iso.part-aa
ISO_URL_PART2=https://github.com/ervinnasiri-99/ointos/releases/download/build27/OintOS-1.0-amd64.iso.part-ab
ISO_SHA256=f9f71483d352daa6c64780e406f6f878abebe3b933abffa096145565a458a852
